        <briefdescription>
<para>Handles the --build command line option. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads the manifest named by --build, the weight table named by --weight and that weight&apos;s glyph sheet, and writes the font file named by --out, relative to the current directory. The written bytes are then loaded back through FreeType and checked against the document that produced them, so a font that does not round-trip fails the command instead of reaching the caller.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>args</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The parsed command line arguments; must carry --build, --weight and --out. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
